Here's the semantic interpretation of the scene images in RDF Turtle format:

Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Foggy Road Scenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .
:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .
:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Low visibility due to fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .
:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

```

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Low visibility due to fog
Severity Score: 0.75